name 'pl-ai-101-V2-mod2-llm-02'
title 'Check for Understanding: Large Language Models'
description ''
question 'Why do large language models produce responses that seem human-like?'

wrong 'They understand language, emotions, and intentions the same way humans do'
right 'They analyze patterns and contextual relationships across massive amounts of text data'
wrong 'They store complete copies of books and websites and retrieve the most relevant passages'
wrong  'They rely on complex algorithms that simulate reasoning processes during conversations'
allow_multiple_attempts true